Z||000000||voyagerspe||09-29-2001||09:50 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MVC-001S_2.JPG"> <P><BR>It fits !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MVC-003S_1.JPG"> <P>well we burned the midnight oil for many many many days <BR>I spent almost twice my budget and it took about 3 times longer than i expected but it runs great. <P>Its not quite done yet it still needs to have the interior put back in it (MR mikes) and It needs paint.  And now after its first Trip to the track it needs a TRANSMISSION. I knew the 125 was weak but I thought  would be able to put a few miles on it before it dies (oh well) however, I did know second was slipping  so it wasnt a surprise when it blew tranny oil out the dip stick tube on my last run of the day. I did win that run (I coasted past the finish line).  Even though I toasted the tranny I still had a great day.  I beat 2 cordobas, 1 acura, 2 mustangs 1 grand prix(v8350) and and a corvette.  <BR>and that was with 2nd gear slipping I lost to  <BR>1 mustang and 1 v8 s-10 .  so I had a great day of racing. I guess I have all winter to come up with a tranny that will take the torque.      ||||reg||6
Z||000001||voyagerspe||09-29-2001||09:58 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MVC-004S_3.JP0G"> <P>oh I wanted to thank my friend reed (hes the guy in the pic with my dog) <BR>he is an automotive wizard that can quote about any spec to anything off the top of his head and he also wired my complete tpi motor by taking the camero and fiero wireing harness apart and mating them together without using any diagrams (he knows all the colors from memory) Its great to have a friend like this  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR> ||||reg||7
