Z||000003||voyagerspe||09-29-2001||11:05 PM||||oops, I guess times would be in order<P>well I race it at tioga speedway which had an 1/8 mile track but they had to shorten it to 334 feet due to the fact that someone couldnt stop in time at the end(ouch) so my best time was 5.80 at 64 mph and that was with 2nd slipping my worst time (last run) was 6.72 and thats when I toasted my tranny<BR>||||reg||1
